  "name": "Renewed Focus",
  "type": "feat",
  "img": "icons/magic/perception/third-eye-blue-red.webp",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<blockquote><p><em>The reserve that other practitioners must retreat and rebuild returns to you almost as fast as you spend it. You gather yourself in moments rather than minutes, mid-fight if the fight demands it, and the working that should have cost you dearly costs almost nothing at all.</em></p></blockquote>\n<p><strong>1st Level</strong></p><ul><li>Your focus pool increases by 1, exceeding the normal maximum.</li><li>Refocus takes 1 minute instead of 10, and restores all spent Focus Points.</li></ul>\n<p><strong>5th Level</strong></p><ul><li>Your focus pool increases by 1 more.</li><li>Once per encounter, you may Refocus as a 3-action activity.</li></ul>\n<p><strong>10th Level</strong></p><ul><li>Once per round, reduce the action cost of a focus spell by 1.<ul><li>A focus spell that costs 1 action becomes a free action.</li></ul></li></ul>\n<p><strong>15th Level</strong></p><ul><li>Once per round, casting a focus spell costs no Focus Points.</li></ul>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>In Foundry:</strong> your focus pool maximum is raised by 1, and by 2 from 5th, past PF2e's usual ceiling of three. The 3-action Refocus is on your Actions tab from 5th.</p>\n<p>For the table: Refocus taking 1 minute and restoring every point (set your focus points to the maximum by hand), the once-per-round action discount from 10th, and the free cast from 15th. A note on every focus spell reminds you of the last two.</p>",
      "gm": ""
    },
